# Git attributes to guarantee binary preservation for all assets
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.webp binary
*.ico binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
*.ttf binary
*.eot binary
*.otf binary
*.pdf binary

